#text("P-192 algebra qualification. The full-width checker verifies 12 manufactured collision controls from the declared 17G,31G,mu_G and relation_lambda_G fixtures: four linear,four quadratic and four projective-pole cases. Every accepted scalar is checked against its point; changed equations and proportional matrices reject. Eight public affine compositions on the existing unknown Q agree under independent affine/Jacobian point operations, and their tautological comparisons supply no scalar. Separately,-3 is a nonsquare in F_r and r=2mod 3, confirming the absence of the order-three path for P-192. No full P-192 norm, Mobius walk or unknown-scalar recovery is claimed by these controls. [pcc:unverified]")
